ng-the-bear#:~:text=The%20Temur%20spat%20curses,to%20hunger%20and%20disease.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Awakening the Bear\" by Jennifer Clarke Wilkes. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 17 Sep 2014."}},{"id":"awakening-the-bear-e6","summary":"Outnumbered Temur are overrun until the cave bear bursts in and rips through the Sultai ranks to Surrak's side, turning the battle.","participants":["cave-bear","surrak","sultai","temur"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/awakening-the-bear","order":40,"story_date":"2014-09-17","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"The cave bear crashed into the ranks of the Sultai, ripping apart the gaunt zombies","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/awakening-the-bear#:~:text=The%20cave%20bear%20crashed,apart%20the%20gaunt%20zombies","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Awakening the Bear","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jennifer Clarke Wilkes"],"date":"2014-09-17","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/awakening-the-bear","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/awakening-the-bear#:~:text=The%20cave%20bear%20crashed,apart%20the%20gaunt%20zombies","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Awakening the Bear\" by Jennifer Clarke Wilkes. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 17 Sep 2014."}},{"id":"sorins-revelation-e3","summary":"A Temur band mistakes Sorin for a Sultai demon-spawn and Sorin kills two warriors with death magic and raises them as vampire thralls.","participants":["sorin-markov","temur-captain","temur","rushka"],"location":"tarkir","importance":"major","page":"stories/sorins-revelation","order":41,"story_date":"2014-09-24","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"Sorin reached out his hand and willed the two leathery corpses back from the dead.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sorins-revelation#:~:text=Sorin%20rea